We have updated Ultra Containers content. Here's what you can get from them:
[*]Firebird’s «Jamming mix» augment;
[*]Freeze’s «Paralyzing mix» augment;
[*]Twins’ «Plasma Turbo Accelerators» augment;
[*]Unique [b]XT skin for Tesla[/b] in an HD style;
[*]The elite [b]XT skin for Gauss[/b];
[*]Detailed [b]Ultra skin for Hunter[/b];
[*]The [b]«Crisis» drone[/b] and the [b]«Armadillo» module[/b].
As well as everything else that can be obtained from regular Containers.

This time we have decided to change the ultra containers content the way your chances to get «Exotic» items will be increased as these Exotic skins are special! During the celebrations you will be able to get the following items from the updated ultra containers:

«Steampunk»-styled Twins skin;
«Steampunk»-styled Mammoth skin;
Animated «Bronze armor» paint
«Crisis» drone;
«Armadillo» module.

Throughout the three days of the event, we’ll have themed decorations in the game:

A holiday-themed paint; 
Holiday-themed billboards on all maps; 
Special parachutes for drop boxes; 
Holiday-themed gold box skin and drop zone.

Daily missions system won’t drastically change, and 3 new mission types will be added:
[LIST]
[*]Activate overdrive in battle;
[*]Finish battle;
[*]Finish battle in specific mode;
[/LIST]

